# ViAna UI Rules

- **Start with** `apps/web/AGENTS.md` and `docs/ui/README.md`.
- Import types from `@viana/contracts` → `packages/contracts/typescript`.
- Never send `job_id` or `gpu_device` in job submit payloads.
- Container docker commands only in `apps/web/src/app/api/container/` (host-side).
- Canvas coordinates must match `video_meta` pixel dimensions; clamp to frame.
- Use mocks when API is ❌ in `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md` — `packages/contracts/fixtures/`.
- Sync job queue from backend `GET /jobs`; localStorage is for UI prefs only.
- See `docs/ui/` for flows, canvas spec, API integration.
